  "prefLabel": "Puc 202.16 Pleading",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Puc 202.16 “Pleading” means a written request for commission action or a written response to a written request for commission action in the form of, including but not limited to, a petition, motion, objection, or reply. The term “pleading” does not include communications in the form of correspondence, such as a letter or email.\n\nSource. #14184, eff 1-24-25",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/puc200.html"
}
